    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=583937727154619203&sectionId=583937727340282691)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtGrKuEAUB_text","label":"ggtGrKuEAUB_text","default":"Here Are The Top Questions We Get About MenoMate"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_0","label":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_0","default":"<p>Health</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_1","label":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_1","default":"<p>Product</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_2","label":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_2","default":"<p>Order</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_3","label":"ggo3FfKXCTw_childItem_3","default":"<p>Reference</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_0","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_0","default":"<p>When can I experience results from MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_1","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_1","default":"<p>I am on a diet (e.g., <strong>Vegan / Ketogenic / Paleo / Kosher</strong>). Can I still take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_2","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_2","default":"<p>Does MenoMate contain <strong>gluten, soy, peanuts, dairy, shellfish</strong> or other common allergens for women?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_3","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_3","default":"<p>I am on <strong>medication</strong> or have existing health conditions. Can I still take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_4","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_4","default":"<p>Is it safe to take if I'm <strong>pregnant / breastfeeding</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_5","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_5","default":"<p>I have had <strong>estrogen-receptor–positive (ER+) breast cancer</strong>. Can I take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_6","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_6","default":"<p>Can <strong>men</strong> take MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_7","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_7","default":"<p>Does MenoMate have any <strong>side effects?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_8","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_8","default":"<p>Does MenoMate contain <strong>caffeine</strong> or any other stimulants?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_9","label":"ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_9","default":"<p>Is there an <strong>age</strong> restriction?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg26-3vvc8m_text","label":"gg26-3vvc8m_text","default":"<p>Every body is different, so results may vary. While some women notice improvements within just 2 weeks, MenoMate typically takes 8–12 weeks to fully support tendon recovery.<br>That’s why we recommend the 3-bottle bundle — it gives your body the time it needs to unlock the full benefits.</p><p><br>Most women who take MenoMate consistently report the following improvements:<br>- By <strong>Week 2:</strong> Hip stiffness begins to ease, making everyday movements feel smoother<br>- By <strong>Week 4: </strong>Pain is noticeably reduced, allowing for more comfortable walking and light activity<br>- By <strong>Week 8:</strong> Many can sleep on their side again without discomfort, enjoying more restful nights<br>- By <strong>Week 12:</strong> Moving freely with little to no pain, feeling stronger, more flexible, and confident in daily activities</p><p><br><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-__U8DkQ8_text","label":"gg-__U8DkQ8_text","default":"<p>Yes. MenoMate is <strong>suitable for all of these diets</strong> and is even suggested as a supportive supplement for women on these nutrition plans. It can help enhance digestion, improve nutrient absorption, and promote overall wellness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Many women following these diets have reported added benefits with MenoMate — including improved digestion, better weight management, more stable mood, and increased energy throughout the day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyq55hpJXo_text","label":"ggyq55hpJXo_text","default":"<p>No, MenoMate is free from these and other common allergens such as tree nuts, eggs, and sesame. It’s also vegan-friendly and suitable for a variety of diets, including keto, paleo, and kosher.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOsfx1VJT5_text","label":"ggOsfx1VJT5_text","default":"<p>If you are on medication, pregnant, breastfeeding, or have any medical conditions, please speak with your doctor before starting MenoMate or any supplement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MenoMate contains potent natural ingredients that may have anti-inflammatory and other physiological effects. If you’re taking medications such as NSAIDs, blood thinners, or COX-2 inhibitors, it’s especially important to consult your healthcare provider to ensure it’s safe and suitable for you.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu8mgAIWod_text","label":"ggu8mgAIWod_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is made with natural, high-quality ingredients and is generally considered safe for pregnant and breastfeeding women.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, because every pregnancy and postpartum journey is unique, we strongly recommend consulting your doctor before starting.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvCmQcIgkZ_text","label":"ggvCmQcIgkZ_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is made with natural, high-quality ingredients and does not contain estrogen or synthetic hormones.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, for your safety, we strongly advise <strong>discussing MenoMate with your oncologist or healthcare provider</strong> before starting, so they can assess whether it is appropriate for your situation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your health journey deserves personalized care, and we’re here to support you however we can. If you’d like to share more details or ask questions privately, our Customer Service Team is always ready to listen: support@wellnessnest.co.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gge3XIep0-V_text","label":"gge3XIep0-V_text","default":"<p>Yes, MenoMate can support men’s health too — especially those experiencing hip pain related to hormonal changes, such as gluteal tendinopathy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While it’s formulated with women’s hormonal and digestive health in mind, its probiotics, anti-inflammatory herbs, and tendon-supportive nutrients can also help men by reducing inflammation, easing joint stiffness, and supporting tendon recovery.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Many customers purchase MenoMate for their partners after seeing improvements themselves, and we love hearing how both experience relief and better mobility.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggX3yVg-pLi_text","label":"ggX3yVg-pLi_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is <strong>not known to have any major side effects</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>MenoMate is made with <strong>high-quality, natural</strong> ingredients and is stimulant-free, making it suitable for long-term daily use. It has been tested for safety and is generally well-tolerated by most women.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While side effects are uncommon, some women may notice mild bloating or digestive changes during the first few days. This is often due to the probiotics in MenoMate beginning to rebalance and support your gut microbiome — a normal, temporary sign that your body is adjusting to the formula — and it usually subsides quickly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you experience any unusual or persistent discomfort, stop taking MenoMate and consult your healthcare provider. Women who are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or managing a medical condition should speak with their doctor before starting MenoMate.</p><p>Following the recommended dosage of 2 capsules per day can help ensure optimal results while minimizing any potential side effects.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwjTaW5t1z_text","label":"ggwjTaW5t1z_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is <strong>100% caffeine-free and stimulant-free</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It’s made with natural, high-quality ingredients, and every component is clearly listed on our packaging and website for full transparency. This makes it safe for daily use, allowing women to enjoy long-term benefits without the jittery effects associated with stimulants.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggd8V29tdVw_text","label":"ggd8V29tdVw_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is formulated for adult women, typically <strong>aged 40 and above</strong>, who are experiencing menopausal, perimenopausal, or postmenopausal symptoms.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are younger and considering use, please consult a pediatrician first.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_0","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_0","default":"<p>Are Wellness Nest supplements <strong>FDA-approved</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_1","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_1","default":"<p>What is the <strong>recommended dosage </strong>for MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_2","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_2","default":"<p>How does the formula <strong>taste</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_3","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_3","default":"<p>Can I <strong>open the capsules and mix</strong> the powder into food or drinks?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_4","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_4","default":"<p>How long does one bottle last?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_5","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_5","default":"<p>What are the exact <strong>ingredients </strong>that go into MenoMate?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_6","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_6","default":"<p>How big are the capsules?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_7","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_7","default":"<p>Do I have to keep MenoMate in the fridge?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_8","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_8","default":"<p>Where are Wellness Nest supplements <strong>manufactured</strong>?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_9","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_9","default":"<p>What if MenoMate doesn't work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_10","label":"ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_10","default":"<p>Why choose this product over others?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJF86Uv9JE_text","label":"ggJF86Uv9JE_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">By law, the FDA does not approve dietary supplements. However, it does regulate both dietary supplements and their ingredients.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">At Wellness Nest, we comply with the FDA’s “Current Good Manufacturing Practice” (cGMP) regulations, established in 2007. These require manufacturers to evaluate products for identity, purity, strength, and composition.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">Every batch of MenoMate is verified by Eurofins (the global leader in pharmaceutical testing) with a </span><a href=\"#gsQk86ZiSq\"><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong><u>Certificate of Analysis (CoA)</u></strong></span></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> to ensure:</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Exact labeled amounts</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> – No underdosing or overdosing.</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>High purity</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> – Free from contaminants like heavy metals or microbes.</span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\">✔ </span><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Accurate identity</strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,74,74);font-size:px;\"> – Correct plant species, probiotic strains, and active compounds.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoBTEkmIoL_text","label":"ggoBTEkmIoL_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">For best results, take <strong>2 capsules each morning</strong> before breakfast with a glass of water.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">If you’ve recently completed a course of antibiotics or feel you need extra digestive and hormonal support, you may take up to <strong>4 capsules daily</strong>.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gIEcQNy8tGX_text","label":"gIEcQNy8tGX_text","default":"<p>MenoMate comes in easy-to-swallow capsules with the <strong>natural scent of turmeric</strong> — a sign of its purity and potency. Turmeric is well known for supporting a healthy inflammatory response, so that natural aroma means you’re getting the real thing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gdWutbyhYWC_text","label":"gdWutbyhYWC_text","default":"<p>We don’t recommend it. MenoMate uses <strong>EMBO Caps®</strong> — a special plant-based capsule that helps deliver the ingredients right where your body can absorb them best. Opening them could reduce their effectiveness, so you’ll get the most benefits by taking them whole.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gHK0K5Az7_7_text","label":"gHK0K5Az7_7_text","default":"<p>Each bottle contains 60 capsules—enough for <strong>30 days</strong> when taking 2 capsules per day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"g7F97lUeGBr_text","label":"g7F97lUeGBr_text","default":"<p><strong>Probiotics</strong> (10 Billion CFU): Bifidobacterium animalis subsp. lactis, Bifidobacterium breve, Lactobacillus gasseri</p><p><strong>Natural Herbs &amp; Extracts</strong>: Turmeric Root Extract (Curcuma longa L.) – 350 mg, Curry Leaf Extract – 50 mg, Black Cohosh Powder Extract – 40 mg, Di-Indolylmethane (DIM) – 40 mg, Moringa Leaf Extract – 35 mg</p><p><strong>Absorption Boosters</strong>: BioPerine® Organic Black Pepper Extract – 3 mg</p><p><strong>Prebiotic Fiber</strong>: Inulin (from Chicory root) – 337.5 mg</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"g33KTP-x6aW_text","label":"g33KTP-x6aW_text","default":"<p>MenoMate capsules are compact and easy to take — each is about <strong>0.9 inches long</strong>, just a little bigger than a long grain of rice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If swallowing capsules isn’t your favorite thing, try taking <strong>one at a time</strong> instead of both together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"geBYGrnhCI5_text","label":"geBYGrnhCI5_text","default":"<p>Nope — MenoMate is designed to be hassle-free. The probiotics we use naturally thrive at room temperature, so you can store your bottle in a cupboard or on your counter without worry.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Each batch is <strong>shelf-stable for up to 2 years</strong> after delivery. For best results, keep it in a <strong>cool, dry spot</strong> —preferably below 77°F (25°C). Avoid direct sunlight or extreme heat.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4Aop4N2de_text","label":"gg4Aop4N2de_text","default":"<p>Wellness Nest supplements are formulated, manufactured, and packaged with care right here in the USA. That said, some of our products may occasionally be backstocked from third-party manufacturers partnering with our main supplier, based in India, China, or Vietnam.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gIACLS1FT60_text","label":"gIACLS1FT60_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference in your menopausal symptoms, reach out within 90 days for a<strong> refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gWUKnRtyXKa_text","label":"gWUKnRtyXKa_text","default":"<p>MenoMate targets <strong>root hormonal imbalances</strong> with carefully measured, science-backed extracts (like Black Cohosh, DIM, and probiotics) that specifically address menopausal issues. We also offer a <strong>90-day money-back guarantee,</strong> so you can try it risk-free.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_0","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is my credit card information secure?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_1","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_1","default":"<p>Do you ship <strong>worldwide</strong> (e.g., Canada, Australia)?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_2","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_2","default":"<p>How does <strong>free shipping</strong> work?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_3","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_3","default":"<p>How do I track my package?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_4","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_4","default":"<p>I didn’t receive a shipping or order confirmation. Help!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_5","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_5","default":"<p>Is this a <strong>one-time</strong> purchase?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_6","label":"ggnGGfpdmHW_childItem_6","default":"<p>How does the <strong>Money-Back Guarantee </strong>work<strong>?</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrqp3j-QXa_text","label":"ggrqp3j-QXa_text","default":"<p>Yes! Your payment details are protected with <strong>bank-level encryption (SSL)</strong> and <strong>PCI-DSS compliance</strong> (the highest security standard). We never store or access your full credit card information—your data stays safe at every step.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To